(7688736, 1259503, 4008, '<td valign="top">Jumping people, quite predictable, but it works nevertheless and you have produced an attractive image. I wonder about the light effect. What is that environment? Or are those paper cut outs in front of a nice light source? Good one.</td>', 'Jumping people, quite predictable, but it works nevertheless and you have produced an attractive image. I wonder about the light effect. What is that environment? Or are those paper cut outs in front of a nice light source? Good one.', '2021-03-05 04:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
