(7688782, 1259511, 30049, '<td valign="top">Perfect application of using a drone!  Love the perspective.  Hiding the remote in your big coat are ya?  :-)  If I had one nit I''d consider fixing the barrel distortion on the edges a little (but if this was not cropped then you''d probably lose too much if it was fixed - like I wouldn''t want to lose anything at the top at all, bottom a smidge of room).</td>', 'Perfect application of using a drone!  Love the perspective.  Hiding the remote in your big coat are ya?  :-)  If I had one nit I''d consider fixing the barrel distortion on the edges a little (but if this was not cropped then you''d probably lose too much if it was fixed - like I wouldn''t want to lose anything at the top at all, bottom a smidge of room).', '2021-03-06 13:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
